<title>USA: Yurie Systems names Harry Carr president.</title>
<headline>Yurie Systems names Harry Carr president.</headline>
<dateline>LANDOVER, Md. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yurie Systems Inc said Wednesday that it has appointed Harry Carr, 40, as its president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Most recently the market development vice president for AT&amp;T Local Services for the Atlantic states, Carr has extensive experience handling both commercial and federal customers, the company said.</p>
<p>Carr will assume his new post on July 1.</p>
</text>
